________________________________________
1. Feature Overview
The DiningOS Menu & Catalog Engine is the foundational product catalog system that powers restaurant ordering, kitchen operations, billing, availability control, analytics, and future inventory integration.
The menu is not simply a list of food items.
It is a structured business model that defines:
•	What customers can order.
•	How items are grouped.
•	How items are priced.
•	What variations exist.
•	What customization options are available.
•	Whether an item can currently be sold.
•	How kitchen preparation should happen.
________________________________________
