8. Important Database Constraints
Unique Item Name
Within a location:
Same category:

Burger

Burger

should be prevented if business rules require uniqueness.
________________________________________
Soft Delete
Never hard delete sold items.
Reason:
Historical orders must always display original item information.
Example:
Old order:
Chicken Biryani
$12
must remain visible even if the menu item is removed later.
