11. Business Rules
Rule 1
Customers only see:
Active Menu

+

Available Items
________________________________________
Rule 2
Out-of-stock items cannot enter a new cart.
________________________________________
Rule 3
Existing orders are not affected by menu changes.
________________________________________
Rule 4
Price changes apply only to future orders.
Existing orders retain original pricing.
________________________________________
Rule 5
Deleting a menu item is actually archival.
