14. Edge Cases
Item Sold Out While In Cart
Example:
Customer adds:
Butter Chicken
Kitchen marks unavailable.
System:
•	Allows existing draft cart to continue.
•	Validates before submission.
•	Shows unavailable message.
________________________________________
Price Changed During Ordering
Example:
Cart:
Coffee $5
Manager changes:
Coffee $6
Before checkout:
System:
•	Shows updated price.
•	Requires confirmation.
________________________________________
Deleted Item With Existing Orders
Old orders display:
Archived Item
with original name and price.
________________________________________
Menu Empty
System should:
•	Show maintenance state.
•	Prevent ordering.
•	Notify manager.
