16. Acceptance Criteria
DiningOS Menu Engine is complete when:
✅ Restaurant can create menus.
✅ Restaurant can create categories.
✅ Restaurant can create items.
✅ Items support variants.
✅ Items support add-ons.
✅ Items support modifiers.
✅ Customer sees only active available items.
✅ Staff can control availability.
✅ Kitchen routing information is available.
✅ Price changes do not corrupt existing orders.
✅ Deleted items remain visible in historical orders.
✅ All changes are tenant isolated.
✅ All sensitive changes are audited.
